# CustomItemTool Resource Pack

Resource pack for the CustomItemTool Minecraft plugin.

## Features
- Custom item models and textures.
- Designed to work with the CustomItemTool plugin.
- Includes resource pack assets and model definitions.

## Installation
1. Download the resource pack ZIP from the Releases section.
2. Configure the resource pack URL in your Minecraft server settings.
3. Restart the server and accept the resource pack when joining.

## Requirements
- Minecraft Java Edition version compatible with the resource pack.
- CustomItemTool plugin installed on the server.

## Important Notes
- This resource pack is intended to be used with the matching CustomItemTool plugin version.
- Custom models may not work on Bedrock Edition through Geyser without a separate Bedrock-compatible pack.
- Compatibility should be tested with your Minecraft server version.

